[external_agent_tool_result]
# Realtime API Media Support

## Image Input

The API **does support image input** but **not video input**.

The exact JSON shape for sending an image is:

```json
{
  "type": "conversation.item.create",
  "item": {
    "type": "message",
    "role": "user",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "input_image",
        "image_url": "data:image/{format};base64,{base64Image}"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

The documentation states: `"gpt-realtime-2 and gpt-realtime also support image input."` There is **no mention of video frame streaming or live video track support**.

## Session Audio Configuration

The current `session.update` audio configuration shape includes:

```json
{
  "audio": {
    "input": {
      "format": {
        "type": "audio/pcm",
        "rate": 24000
      },
      "turn_detection": {
        "type": "semantic_vad"
      }
    },
    "output": {
      "format": {
        "type": "audio/pcm"
      },
      "voice": "marin"
    }
  }
}
```

The `output_modalities` field accepts: `"output_modalities": ["audio"]` or `["text"]` or both.

No `audio.input.transcription` field appears in the documented configuration.
[/external_agent_tool_result]

